{"id":"81eaa2bfca5c6209","group":"92","path":"92/92-lem-reducibility-transitive.md","title":"Reducibility Transitive","display":"lem-reducibility-transitive — Reducibility Transitive","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-lem-reducibility-transitive","aliases":["92-lem-reducibility-transitive"],"display":"lem-reducibility-transitive — Reducibility Transitive","depends_on":["[[92-df-many-one-reducible]]"],"source":"原书之外的有效程序编号、停机问题、度与多一归约背景；本库明示可接受编号与参数条件","source_status":"外部递归论背景"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-lem-reducibility-transitive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-lem-reducibility-transitive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-reducibility-transitive — Reducibility Transitive"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5b356f91d7193d28\" href=\"?note=5b356f91d7193d28\" title=\"92-df-many-one-reducible\">92-df-many-one-reducible</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"原书之外的有效程序编号、停机问题、度与多一归约背景；本库明示可接受编号与参数条件"},{"key":"source_status","html":"外部递归论背景"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A, B, C \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\">\\(A, B, C \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\leq_m B\">\\(A \\leq_m B\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5b356f91d7193d28\" href=\"?note=5b356f91d7193d28\" title=\"92-df-many-one-reducible\">92-df-many-one-reducible</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B \\leq_m C\">\\(B \\leq_m C\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}reducibility\\text{-}transitive}\\vdash\n(A\\leq_m B\\land B\\leq_m C)\\Longrightarrow A\\leq_m C.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}reducibility\\text{-}transitive}\\vdash\n(A\\leq_m B\\land B\\leq_m C)\\Longrightarrow A\\leq_m C.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_m\">\\(\\leq_m\\)</span>具有传递性</li>\n<li>证明：设<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>归约<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>到<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>归约<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>到<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h = g \\circ f\">\\(h = g \\circ f\\)</span>归约<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>到<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n \\in A \\leftrightarrow f(n) \\in B \\leftrightarrow g(f(n)) \\in C\">\\(n \\in A \\leftrightarrow f(n) \\in B \\leftrightarrow g(f(n)) \\in C\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span>是递归函数（复合保持递归性）</li>\n<li>因此<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\leq_m C\">\\(A \\leq_m C\\)</span></li>\n<li>这使<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_m\">\\(\\leq_m\\)</span>成为预序关系</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-many-one-reducible","status":"resolved","id":"5b356f91d7193d28","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-many-one-reducible]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-many-one-reducible","status":"resolved","id":"5b356f91d7193d28","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A \\leq_m B$ (see [[92-df-many-one-reducible]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A, B, C \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"A \\leq_m B","display":false},{"tex":"B \\leq_m C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}reducibility\\text{-}transitive}\\vdash\n(A\\leq_m B\\land B\\leq_m C)\\Longrightarrow A\\leq_m C.","display":true},{"tex":"\\leq_m","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"h = g \\circ f","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"n \\in A \\leftrightarrow f(n) \\in B \\leftrightarrow g(f(n)) \\in C","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"A \\leq_m C","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_m","display":false}],"bytes":1062,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-242","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-lem-reducibility-transitive]]"}],"outgoing":["5b356f91d7193d28"]}